NOTE ON BUNDLED DATA (data/)

The questionnaire text, reversal rules and cut-off values under data/ are
derived from public documents published by the Ministry of Health, Labour and
Welfare of Japan (MHLW). Those documents are made available under the Japanese
Government Standard Terms of Use for Public Data (Public Data License 1.0),
which is compatible with CC BY 4.0. Each CSV carries its own `# source:` and
`# license:` header naming the document it was transcribed from.

This MIT license covers the source code of this project. It does not extend to
the underlying MHLW documents, which remain under their own terms.
